        "geo": "rectangle",
        "color": "blue",
        "labelColor": "black",
        "fill": "semi",
        "dash": "solid",
        "size": "s",
        "font": "sans",
        "text": "[Pages & Routing View]\n- LoginPage.jsx: JWT credentials form, token storage, auth guard\n- ChannelsPage.jsx: Grid of broadcast channels, online badges\n- ControlRoomPage.jsx: Playout master dashboard & controls\n- ServersPage.jsx: Flussonic media server configs & testing\n- UsersPage.jsx: RBAC administration (roles & assigned channels)\nResponsibilities & Capabilities:\n* Protected route authorization with Redux auth state\n* Real-time channel telemetry monitoring\n* Responsive TV broadcast control room layout",
        "align": "start",
        "verticalAlign": "start",
        "growY": 0,
        "url": "",
        "scale": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "shape:fe_components",
      "typeName": "shape",
      "type": "geo",
      "parentId": "page:page",
      "index": "a0004",
      "x": 860,
      "y": 250,
      "rotation": 0,
      "isLocked": false,
      "opacity": 1,
      "meta": {},
      "props": {
        "w": 740,
        "h": 410,
        "geo": "rectangle",
        "color": "blue",
        "labelColor": "black",
        "fill": "semi",
        "dash": "solid",
        "size": "s",
        "font": "sans",
        "text": "[Control Room Core UI Components]\n- BroadcastHeader.jsx:\n  * Master ON-AIR badge, Start/Stop Broadcast triggers\n  * Quick Fire L-Band (15s/30s/60s) & Ashton Band buttons\n- VideoSection.jsx (Dual Player Architecture):\n  * Local Preview: HTML5 native <video> for library media inspection\n  * Live PGM Player: Hls.js low-latency live broadcast feed player\n  * check-online polling loop (POST /channels/check-online, 3x retry tolerance)\n- PlaylistTable.jsx:\n  * Drag-and-drop broadcast schedule ordering & item status\n    (QUEUED, PLAYING, PLAYED)\n- AssetLibrary.jsx: Media catalog grid & chunked upload modal",
        "align": "start",
        "verticalAlign": "start",
        "growY": 0,
        "url": "",
        "scale": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "shape:fe_live_controls",
      "typeName": "shape",
      "type": "geo",
      "parentId": "page:page",
      "index": "a0005",
      "x": 1640,
      "y": 250,
      "rotation": 0,
      "isLocked": false,
      "opacity": 1,
      "meta": {},
      "props": {
        "w": 720,
        "h": 410,
        "geo": "rectangle",
        "color": "blue",
        "labelColor": "black",
        "fill": "semi",
        "dash": "solid",
        "size": "s",
        "font": "sans",
        "text": "[Live Branding & Modal Controllers]\n- LiveControls.jsx:\n  * Station Logo: toggle on/off, corner/custom X/Y %, scale\n  * Animated Station Bug: toggle, GIF / PNG support, position\n  * Crawling Ticker: live breaking text, speed, colors, font\n- MoreSettingsModal.jsx:\n  * L-Band DVE Squeeze: window width/height, position X/Y\n  * Ashton Band: lower-third banner toggle, squeeze vs overlay\n- ScheduleModal.jsx:\n  * Calendar & time-based automated commercial interruption programming\n  * Day-of-week recurrence & priority rules",
        "align": "start",
        "verticalAlign": "start",
        "growY": 0,
        "url": "",
        "scale": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "shape:fe_redux",
      "typeName": "shape",
      "type": "geo",
      "parentId": "page:page",
      "index": "a0006",
      "x": 2400,
      "y": 250,
      "rotation": 0,
      "isLocked": false,
      "opacity": 1,
      "meta": {},
      "props": {
        "w": 720,
        "h": 410,
        "geo": "rectangle",
        "color": "blue",
        "labelColor": "black",
        "fill": "semi",
        "dash": "solid",
        "size": "s",
        "font": "sans",
        "text": "[Client State Management (Redux Toolkit)]\n- authSlice: user profile, JWT access token, roles\n- channelSlice: active channel metadata, branding state, stream status\n- playlistSlice: playlist items, currently playing item index\n- assetSlice: media asset catalog, upload progress tracking\n- serverSlice: media server configs, Flussonic credentials\n- userSlice: user accounts & assigned channel mapping\nStore Architecture:\n* useSelector() for reactive UI subscriptions\n* createAsyncThunk for API actions (fetch, update, delete)",
        "align": "start",
        "verticalAlign": "start",
        "growY": 0,
        "url": "",
        "scale": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "shape:fe_networking",
      "typeName": "shape",
      "type": "geo",
      "parentId": "page:page",
      "index": "a0007",
      "x": 3160,
      "y": 250,
      "rotation": 0,
      "isLocked": false,
      "opacity": 1,
      "meta": {},
      "props": {
        "w": 740,
        "h": 410,
        "geo": "rectangle",
        "color": "blue",
        "labelColor": "black",
        "fill": "semi",
        "dash": "solid",
        "size": "s",
        "font": "sans",
        "text": "[Client Networking & WebSocket Client]\n- api/axios.js (HTTP Client):\n  * Bearer JWT token injection on outgoing requests\n  * Response Interceptor Queue: on 401 Unauthorized, queues requests,\n    transparently calls /auth/refresh, replays queue on new token\n- Socket.IO Client (Real-time Gateway):\n  * Joins isolated channel rooms: channel:<channelId>\n  * Inbound Event Handlers:\n    - stream_started / stream_stopped\n    - stream_item_playing / stream_item_played\n    - branding_updated (logo, bug, ticker, lband, ashton)\n    - schedule_triggered / schedule_completed",
        "align": "start",
        "verticalAlign": "start",
        "growY": 0,
        "url": "",
        "scale": 1
      }
    },
