        "size": "m",
        "font": "sans",
        "text": "TIER 3: PLAYOUT ENGINE CORE TIER (FFmpeg Dual-Process / ZeroMQ IPC / Real-Time Feeder / Scheduler)",
        "align": "start",
        "verticalAlign": "start",
        "growY": 0,
        "url": "",
        "scale": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "shape:pe_stream_manager",
      "typeName": "shape",
      "type": "geo",
      "parentId": "page:page",
      "index": "a0014",
      "x": 140,
      "y": 1320,
      "rotation": 0,
      "isLocked": false,
      "opacity": 1,
      "meta": {},
      "props": {
        "w": 720,
        "h": 660,
        "geo": "rectangle",
        "color": "green",
        "labelColor": "black",
        "fill": "semi",
        "dash": "solid",
        "size": "s",
        "font": "sans",
        "text": "[StreamManager (streamManager.js)]\n- Properties & Registries:\n  * activeStreams: Map<channelId, { channel, encoder, feeder }>\n  * nextZmqPort: 5600+ (auto-increment allocation per channel)\n  * fireTimers: Map<channelId, { lbandTimer, ashtonTimer }>\n- Broadcast Lifecycle Operations:\n  * startStream(channelId, startIndex, options):\n    1. Pre-provisions RTMP stream on Flussonic Media Server\n    2. Restores leftover preScheduleBranding if interrupted\n    3. Spawns long-running EncoderService on unique ZMQ port\n    4. Spawns FeederService connected to encoder.process.stdin\n    5. Emits stream_started via Socket.IO\n  * stopStream(channelId):\n    Gracefully shuts down feeder and encoder, cleans timers & sockets\n  * fireLBand(channelId, durationSec):\n    Triggers DVE squeeze, sets auto-revert timer to restore full screen\n  * fireAshton(channelId, durationSec, squeeze):\n    Triggers Ashton lower-third banner & squeeze, sets auto-revert timer",
        "align": "start",
        "verticalAlign": "start",
        "growY": 0,
        "url": "",
        "scale": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "shape:pe_feeder_service",
      "typeName": "shape",
      "type": "geo",
      "parentId": "page:page",
      "index": "a0015",
      "x": 900,
      "y": 1320,
      "rotation": 0,
      "isLocked": false,
      "opacity": 1,
      "meta": {},
      "props": {
        "w": 860,
        "h": 660,
        "geo": "rectangle",
        "color": "green",
        "labelColor": "black",
        "fill": "semi",
        "dash": "solid",
        "size": "s",
        "font": "sans",
        "text": "[FeederService (feederService.js)]\n- Real-Time Media Feeder Engine:\n  * Spawns decoder FFmpeg process for each playlist item:\n    ffmpeg -re -ss <offset> -i <path> -vf scale=1280:720,pad=...,fps=25 -f mpegts pipe:1\n  * Pipes raw MPEG-TS stdout to encoder stdin:\n    this.currentDecoder.stdout.pipe(this.encoderProcess.stdin, { end: false })\n  * Playback State Tracking:\n    getCurrentPlaybackPosition() -> { index, offsetSeconds }\n  * Standby Slate Generator:\n    streamStandbySlate(duration): outputs live test pattern when playlist queue is empty!\n- Commercial Break Interruption Engine:\n  * interruptWithSchedule(schedule):\n    1. Snapshots active playback PTS & pre-schedule branding state\n    2. Kills regular decoder gracefully without closing encoder stdin\n    3. Spawns decoder for commercial ad assets with Back-In countdown timer\n    4. Upon ad completion, calls restorePreScheduleBranding()\n    5. Seamlessly resumes regular playlist item at exact frame offset!",
        "align": "start",
        "verticalAlign": "start",
        "growY": 0,
        "url": "",
        "scale": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "shape:pe_encoder_service",
      "typeName": "shape",
      "type": "geo",
      "parentId": "page:page",
      "index": "a0016",
      "x": 1800,
      "y": 1320,
      "rotation": 0,
      "isLocked": false,
      "opacity": 1,
      "meta": {},
      "props": {
        "w": 1060,
        "h": 660,
        "geo": "rectangle",
        "color": "green",
        "labelColor": "black",
        "fill": "semi",
        "dash": "solid",
        "size": "s",
        "font": "sans",
        "text": "[EncoderService (encoderService.js)]\n- Master Encoding FFmpeg Process:\n  * Long-running process spawned with stdio: ['pipe', 'pipe', 'pipe']\n  * Video encoding: libx264, veryfast preset, GOP=50, 25fps, yuv420p\n  * Audio encoding: aac, 44100Hz stereo, 128kbps\n  * Dual Output Tee Muxer:\n    - Local low-latency HLS: streams/<channelId>/hls/index.m3u8 (1s chunks)\n    - Remote RTMP: rtmp://<flussonic>/static/<streamKey> (+global_header)\n- ZeroMQ IPC Filtergraph Controller:\n  * ZeroMQ Request socket (zmq.Request()) connected to tcp://127.0.0.1:<zmqPort>\n  * sendZmqCommand(commandString, timeoutMs = 700):\n    Directly injects live runtime commands into FFmpeg filtergraph!\n- Runtime Overlay Control APIs:\n  * setLogoEnabled(enabled) / updateLogoPosition(pos, size, mx, my)\n  * setTickerEnabled(enabled) / updateTickerPositions(mb, speed)\n  * setBugEnabled(enabled) / updateBugPosition(pos, size, x, y)\n  * setLBandEnabled(enabled) / setLBandSmootherstep(targetW, targetH, targetX, targetY)\n  * setAshtonLive(enabled, squeeze)",
        "align": "start",
        "verticalAlign": "start",
        "growY": 0,
        "url": "",
        "scale": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "shape:pe_scheduler_branding",
      "typeName": "shape",
      "type": "geo",
      "parentId": "page:page",
      "index": "a0017",
      "x": 2900,
      "y": 1320,
      "rotation": 0,
      "isLocked": false,
      "opacity": 1,
      "meta": {},
      "props": {
        "w": 1000,
        "h": 660,
        "geo": "rectangle",
        "color": "green",
        "labelColor": "black",
        "fill": "semi",
        "dash": "solid",
        "size": "s",
        "font": "sans",
        "text": "[Scheduler & Branding Engine]\n- SchedulerService (schedulerService.js):\n  * 24/7 Playout Clock Service checking schedules every 5 seconds\n  * Checks active channels, enabled schedules, date ranges & day-of-week\n  * Evaluates dailyStartTime & dailyEndTime (supports midnight crossing!)\n  * Priority ordering & duplicate prevention (lastAiredDate = YYYY-MM-DD)\n  * Dispatches scheduled events:\n    - video: triggers feeder.interruptWithSchedule(schedule)\n    - lband: triggers streamManager.fireLBand(channelId, duration)\n    - ashton: triggers streamManager.fireAshton(channelId, duration, squeeze)\n- BrandingAssets (brandingAssets.js):\n  * ensureBrandingFiles(): initializes transparent PNGs / GIFs in channel dir\n  * renderTickerImage(): uses Sharp + SVG to generate:\n    - ticker_bg.png: static 1280px background bar\n    - ticker.png: smooth scrolling text strip with full Unicode / Hindi support\n  * buildBackInTimerFilter(): builds drawtext countdown filter for commercials",
        "align": "start",
        "verticalAlign": "start",
        "growY": 0,
        "url": "",
        "scale": 1
      }
    },
