        "size": "s",
        "font": "sans",
        "text": "[MongoDB Database Models (Mongoose ORM)]\n- User: username, password (bcrypt), role (super_admin | admin | user), assignedChannels [ObjectId]\n- Server: name, streamUrl, hlsBaseUrl, rtmpBaseUrl, serverUsername, serverPasswordEncrypted (AES-256)\n- Channel: name, server (ref), assignedUser (ref), streamKey, hlsUrl, rtmpUrl, status (IDLE | RUNNING | ERROR),\n  currentPlayingIndex, currentAssetId, outputSettings { resolution, width, height, fps, videoBitrate, audioBitrate },\n  branding { logo, bug, ticker, lband, ashton, preScheduleBranding }\n- Playlist: channel (ref), name, loop (boolean), items: [{ asset: ref, order: Number, status: enum }]\n- Asset: originalName, fileName, filePath, thumbnailPath, fileSize, duration, durationFormatted, mimeType, status\n- Schedule: channel (ref), title, type (video | lband | ashton), daysOfWeek, startDate, endDate,\n  dailyStartTime, dailyEndTime, duration, ashtonSqueeze, assets [ref], priority, lastAiredDate\n- RefreshToken: user (ref), tokenHash, expiresAt, revoked (boolean)",
        "align": "start",
        "verticalAlign": "start",
        "growY": 0,
        "url": "",
        "scale": 1
      }
    },
