    {
      "id": "shape:dd_feeder",
      "typeName": "shape",
      "type": "geo",
      "parentId": "page:page",
      "index": "a0023",
      "x": 140,
      "y": 2700,
      "rotation": 0,
      "isLocked": false,
      "opacity": 1,
      "meta": {},
      "props": {
        "w": 600,
        "h": 360,
        "geo": "rectangle",
        "color": "red",
        "labelColor": "black",
        "fill": "semi",
        "dash": "solid",
        "size": "s",
        "font": "sans",
        "text": "[Feeder Decoder Process (ffmpeg -re)]\n- Command & Execution:\n  ffmpeg -re -ss <startOffset> -i <asset.mp4>\n  -vf scale=1280:720:force_original_aspect_ratio=decrease,\n      pad=1280:720:(ow-iw)/2:(oh-ih)/2,fps=25\n  -c:v rawvideo -c:a pcm_s16le -f mpegts pipe:1\n- Pacing & Normalization:\n  Forces all media files to 1280x720 25fps MPEG-TS.\n- Non-stop Pipe Feed:\n  currentDecoder.stdout.pipe(encoderProcess.stdin, { end: false })\n  Encoder stdin stays permanently open across track changes!",
        "align": "start",
        "verticalAlign": "start",
        "growY": 0,
        "url": "",
        "scale": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "shape:dd_ipc_pipe",
      "typeName": "shape",
      "type": "geo",
      "parentId": "page:page",
      "index": "a0024",
      "x": 780,
      "y": 2700,
      "rotation": 0,
      "isLocked": false,
      "opacity": 1,
      "meta": {},
      "props": {
        "w": 460,
        "h": 360,
        "geo": "rectangle",
        "color": "red",
        "labelColor": "black",
        "fill": "semi",
        "dash": "solid",
        "size": "s",
        "font": "sans",
        "text": "[Anonymous Stdin IPC Pipe]\n- Continuous byte stream (MPEG-TS)\n- Seamless Loop:\n  feeder loops playlist items; when item N ends,\n  item N+1 spawns immediately and pipes to same stdin.\n- Commercial Break Interruption:\n  feeder pauses main pipe, saves exact PTS,\n  streams commercial ad MPEG-TS with Back-In timer,\n  then seamlessly resumes main video at saved offset!\n- Standby Slate Generator:\n  outputs synthetic color bars to prevent encoder starvation.",
        "align": "start",
        "verticalAlign": "start",
        "growY": 0,
        "url": "",
        "scale": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "shape:dd_encoder",
      "typeName": "shape",
      "type": "geo",
      "parentId": "page:page",
      "index": "a0025",
      "x": 1280,
      "y": 2700,
      "rotation": 0,
      "isLocked": false,
      "opacity": 1,
      "meta": {},
      "props": {
        "w": 1160,
        "h": 360,
        "geo": "rectangle",
        "color": "red",
        "labelColor": "black",
        "fill": "semi",
        "dash": "solid",
        "size": "s",
        "font": "sans",
        "text": "[Master Encoder Process (ffmpeg)]\n- Command:\n  ffmpeg -y -f mpegts -i pipe:0 \\\n    -loop 1 -i logo.png \\\n    -loop 1 -i ticker_bg.png \\\n    -loop 1 -i ticker.png \\\n    -loop 1 -i lband.png \\\n    -loop 1 -i ashton.png \\\n    -ignore_loop 0 -i bug.gif \\\n    -filter_complex \"<8_LAYER_FILTERGRAPH>\" \\\n    -map \"[vout]\" -map \"0:a?\" \\\n    -c:v libx264 -preset veryfast -g 50 -keyint_min 25 -sc_threshold 0 \\\n    -b:v 2500k -pix_fmt yuv420p -flags +global_header \\\n    -c:a aac -b:a 128k -ar 44100 -ac 2 \\\n    -f tee \"[f=hls:hls_time=1:hls_list_size=3]streams/.../index.m3u8|[f=flv]rtmp://.../static/...\"",
        "align": "start",
        "verticalAlign": "start",
        "growY": 0,
        "url": "",
        "scale": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "shape:dd_filtergraph",
      "typeName": "shape",
      "type": "geo",
      "parentId": "page:page",
      "index": "a0026",
      "x": 140,
      "y": 3090,
      "rotation": 0,
      "isLocked": false,
      "opacity": 1,
      "meta": {},
      "props": {
        "w": 2300,
        "h": 470,
        "geo": "rectangle",
        "color": "red",
        "labelColor": "black",
        "fill": "semi",
        "dash": "solid",
        "size": "s",
        "font": "sans",
        "text": "[The Complex 8-Layer Filtergraph Architecture Inside FFmpeg]\nStage 1: Background Canvases:\n  color=c=black:s=1280x720:r=25[lband_bg]; color=c=black:s=1280x720:r=25[ashton_bg]\nStage 2: Crawling Ticker Pre-Compositing:\n  [2:v][3:v] overlay@ticktext=x='...':y='0':format=auto [tickbar_raw]; [tickbar_raw] crop@tick_crop=w=...:h=ih:x=0:y=0 [tickbar]\nStage 3: ZeroMQ Broker & 3-Way Video Split:\n  [0:v] zmq=bind_address=tcp\\\\://127.0.0.1\\\\:<port>,split=3 [v_full][v_lband_in][v_ashton_in]\nStage 4: Broadcast DVE Squeeze for Uncut L-Band Graphic:\n  [v_lband_in] scale@lband_sq=w='...':h='...':eval=frame [v_lband_scaled]; [4:v] format=rgba [lband_g]\n  [lband_bg][lband_g] overlay@lband_gfx=x=0:y=0 [lband_base]; [lband_base][v_lband_scaled] overlay@lband_vid_pos=x='...':y='...' [lband_composite]\nStage 5: Ashton Band Lower-Third Squeeze & Direct Overlay:\n  [5:v] format=rgba,split [ashton_sq_g][ashton_ov_g]; [ashton_bg][ashton_sq_g] overlay@ashton_sq_gfx=x=0:y='...' [ashton_base]\n  [v_ashton_in] scale@ashton_sq=w=1280:h='...':eval=frame [v_ashton_scaled]; [ashton_base][v_ashton_scaled] overlay@ashton_sq_vid=x=0:y=0 [ashton_sq_composite]\nStage 6: Master Compositing Switches:\n  [v_full][lband_composite] overlay@lband_master=x='...':y='...' [v_after_lband]\n  [v_after_lband][ashton_sq_composite] overlay@ashton_squeeze=x='...':y='...' [v_after_ashton_sq]\n  [v_after_ashton_sq][ashton_ov_g] overlay@ashton_overlay=x='...':y='...' [v_after_ashton]\nStage 7: Animated Station Bug Overlay:\n  [6:v] scale@bug_scale=w=...:h=...:eval=frame [v_bug_scaled]; [v_after_ashton][v_bug_scaled] overlay@bug=x='...':y='...' [v_after_bug]\nStage 8: Station Logo & Crawling Ticker (Top of Z-Order):\n  [1:v] scale@logo_scale=w=...:h=...:eval=frame [v_logo_scaled]; [v_after_bug][v_logo_scaled] overlay@logo=x='...':y='...' [v_after_logo]\n  [v_after_logo][tickbar] overlay@tick=x='...':y='...' [vout]",
        "align": "start",
        "verticalAlign": "start",
        "growY": 0,
        "url": "",
        "scale": 1
      }
    },
