        "color": "grey",
        "labelColor": "black",
        "fill": "semi",
        "dash": "solid",
        "size": "s",
        "font": "sans",
        "text": "[ZeroMQ IPC REQ/REP Client]\n- Socket: zmq.Request()\n- Connects: tcp://127.0.0.1:<port>\n  (e.g., port 5600 for channel 1, 5601...)\n- Strict Timeout Race:\n  Promise.race([\n    receivePromise,\n    timeoutPromise (700ms)\n  ])\n- Auto-reconnect:\n  Recovers cleanly if FFmpeg restarts.",
        "align": "start",
        "verticalAlign": "start",
        "growY": 0,
